ct 12, the record for Bertie County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair came in at 59% of normal, and August to September at 61%. Grid 19414 had its driest year in 2007 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
